 of flying \n• the world is changing every day - so it does in this game! Procedural generated graphics will make \"tiny wings\" look different every day you play\n • Four game modes\n • Daily mode with new islands and missions every day\n • 240 birds to unlock\n • Night mode: play the game at night \n• upgrade your nest by fulfilling tasks\n• iPad only: Split screen multiplayer!\n• Supports Game Center with 30 tricky achievements\n• Supports iCloud syncronization", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/tiny-wings/id417817520?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 4.75657, "trackCensoredName": "Tiny Wings", "minimumOsVersion": "14", "sellerUrl": "http://www.andreasilliger.com/", "languageCodesISO2A": ["NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes": "40254464", "formattedPrice": "￦4,400", "trackContentRating": "4+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 152, "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 4.75657, "artistId": 417817523, "artistName": "Andreas Illiger", "userRatingCount": 152}]}